{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UcZzfSFsMc3H2d8eSPKhAz","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_8/projects/acr-vla-conformal-refinement/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# acr-vla-conformal-refinement — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-13 03:01 UTC | 更新原因: plan_001 启动：架构参数确认(D004) + 不等Dream直接P0(D005)\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n在 flow-matching VLA 上叠加在线自适应多元 conformal prediction + 学习型 CRM，用 per-DOF conformal 特征引导维度选择性动作校正。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP ✅, plan_001 启动中）\\\\n- **MVP**: per-DOF 全面碾压标量/无uncertainty baseline（oracle 30-39%, K=10 estimated 20-25%）\\\\n- **基础设施**: SmolVLA (450M params, 0.86GB VRAM, K=10 batched 450ms) + LIBERO 环境就绪\\\\n- **架构确认**: action_dim=6, H_eff=5 (截取 chunk_size=50 前 5 步), CGS 40D\\\\n- **Dream**: zombie（崩溃占槽），已决策不等 Dream 直接启动 P0\\\\n- **代码框架**: 7/7 核心模块已创建，待按实际参数更新\\\\n\\\\n## Kill Criteria\\\\n1. **A3 ablation (plan_002)**: CRM without conformal features 与 full ACR-VLA 差距 <2% → Claim 1 不成立\\\\n2. **COC 验证 (plan_005)**: Spearman ρ < 0.3 AND 无 >10% volume 收窄 → fallback episode-level ACI\\\\n3. **SRPO stacking (plan_004)**: gain < 2% → Claim 3 降级\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 Phase A: 下载 LIBERO demo + 更新代码(action_dim=6, H_eff=5) + 实现 train/eval 主体\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 Phase B: CRM 训练（LIBERO-Spatial + Object）\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 Phase C: 评估（LIBERO standard + LIBERO-Plus）\\\\n- [ ] Dream zombie 清理后重新提交\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 已分配: autodl-4090 (RTX 4090 × 1, cuda:0)\\\\n- plan_001: ~25h H100 ≈ 50-75h RTX 4090 (2-3 天)\\\\n- P0 总计: 59h H100 | P1: 51h | P2: 30h | 全项目: ~140h H100\\\\n- 目标: CoRL 2026 (May 29) 需 GPU 扩容; ICLR 2027 当前资源可行\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-13 | 不等 Dream 重新提交，直接启动 P0 实验。Dream zombie 占槽，Reviewer  | — |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-13 | Horizon 策略：截取 chunk 前 H_eff=5 步，action_dim=6。CGS 输 | — |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 通过，GO — 进入 research 阶段 | mvp-point-reaching |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-13 | 采纳 Reviewer 建议完善 MVP：增加 B vs C 对比（>5% MSE）、K=10 es | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 方案确定：3D Point-Reaching Motivating Experiment 验 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1794, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U6BBV3mx4ktHfYbR5GdLQQ","session_id":"01d718a6-ac11-4c69-ac4b-36f76b2791b4","uuid":"3014c26a-0a0a-48fd-ac1a-03b6c01fa9a1","timestamp":"2026-05-13T03:21:22.800Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0163tmetaJWuGVZgNxgiFDNP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BKhDRY6PnTCyzV6xjYAHLQ","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"acr-vla-conformal-refinement","file":"paper_framing.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2310,"cache_read_input_tokens":16886,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2310,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":44,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U6BBV3mx4ktHfYbR5GdLQQ","session_id":"01d718a6-ac11-4c69-ac4b-36f76b2791b4","uuid":"d4df1a83-720c-4613-8e44-4584057e495a"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BKhDRY6PnTCyzV6xjYAHLQ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_8/projects/acr-vla-conformal-refinement/paper_framing.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Paper Framing — acr-vla-conformal-refinement\\\\n\\\\n## Target Venue\\\\n- Primary: CoRL 2026 (abstract May 26, paper May 29) — 极紧，需 GPU 扩容至 ≥2x H100 才可行\\\\n- Backup: ICLR 2027 (expected deadline ~Sep-Oct 2026) — 充足时间\\\\n- 决策点: 若 3 天内 GPU 未扩容，放弃 CoRL，瞄 ICLR 2027\\\\n\\\\n## Core Insight\\\\nPer-DOF conformal statistics from multivariate CP on flow-matching VLA samples encode \\\\\\\"which action dimensions are uncertain and how they co-vary\\\\\\\" — fundamentally richer information than scalar uncertainty scores. A lightweight learned module conditioned on these structured features can perform dimension-selective action correction: aggressively correcting high-uncertainty DOFs while preserving confident predictions elsewhere.\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (3 条，均可证伪)\\\\n1. **Per-DOF conformal features enable dimension-selective correction**: CGS 提取的 45D 结构化 uncertainty 特征（per-DOF std + conformal radius + ellipsoid volume）比标量 uncertainty（ReconVLA 的 Euclidean distance）和无 uncertainty conditioning 的残差策略（A2C2 类）提供显著更好的 action correction。\\\\n   - 验证: MVP (✅ done) + A3 ablation (make-or-break) + A4 ablation + feature importance analysis\\\\n   - Kill criterion: A3 (CRM without conformal features) 与 full ACR-VLA 差距 <2% → claim 不成立\\\\n\\\\n2. **ACI+COC 在分布偏移下维持 calibrated uncertainty，无需外部监督**: Chunk Overlap Consistency 提供自参考覆盖信号，ACI 在线更新 conformal threshold，在任意分布偏移下维持长期平均覆盖保证。\\\\n   - 验证: COC-success Spearman ρ + ACI 收敛 + ellipsoid volume vs static\\\\n   - Kill criterion: Spearman ρ < 0.3 AND ellipsoid volume 无 >10% 收窄 → fallback to episode-level ACI\\\\n\\\\n3. **ACR-VLA 与 training-time 方法正交互补**: 作为 inference-time 模块可叠加在 SRPO (82.1% LIBERO-Plus SOTA) 上进一步提升。\\\\n   - 验证: ACR-VLA + SRPO > SRPO alone\\\\n   - Kill criterion: stacking gain < 2% → claim 降级为\\\\\\\"complementary in principle\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Story Spine\\\\n- **Problem**: Flow-matching VLAs 在标准 benchmark 上接近饱和(97-99%)，但 LIBERO-Plus 暴露了分布偏移下的灾难性鲁棒性缺口。现有方法分别解决检测(SAFE)、样本选择(ReconVLA)、训练时增强(RobustVLA/DiG-Flow/SRPO)，但没有方法在推理时利用结构化 uncertainty 信息主动校正动作。\\\\n- **Gap**: ReconVLA 用标量 Euclidean distance 做样本选择——丢弃跨维度协方差结构，且无法合成优于任何单个样本的动作。CP-in-the-Loop 通过 planning 闭环但非学习型参数化。UPS 用 CP 做策略门控但不将 conformal 特征作为校正网络输入。A2C2/PLD 学习残差但不利用 calibrated uncertainty features。\\\\n- **Our angle**: 第一个将多元 conformal 统计量作为学习型校正模块直接输入特征的方法。关键 insight 是 per-DOF conformal 特征编码\\\\\\\"哪些维度不确定+跨维度协方差\\\\\\\"，使 CRM 能做维度选择性校正。\\\\n- **Headline result template**: \\\\\\\"On LIBERO-Plus, ACR-VLA improves base VLA success by X%, and when stacked on SRPO (82.1%), achieves Y% — demonstrating that inference-time conformal correction provides orthogonal value beyond training-time optimization.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\\\\n1. **K=10 covariance 估计可靠性** (p/n=0.7): Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage 是标准方案，MVP 已验证 K=10 estimated 仍有效（衰减 ~15pp 但仍显著）。若审稿人追问，可加 K=20 ablation。\\\\n2. **CRM 131K 参数表达力**: 故意轻量——防 overfitting + 保持推理速度。ablation 可测 dim 512 版本。\\\\n3. **Synthetic augmentation 覆盖不全** (layout/language 不可覆盖): Honest limitation。ACI 在线适应部分弥补。per-perturbation breakdown 是透明呈现。\\\\n4. **仿真 only**: CoRL 接受 sim-only，LIBERO-Plus 是 recognized benchmark。\\\\n5. **DiU 的 single-pass uncertainty 更高效**: DiU 捕获 aleatoric uncertainty（在分布内也高），CGS 捕获 epistemic uncertainty（分布偏移时升高）。A7 ablation 验证区分。\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3079, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U6BBV3mx4ktHfYbR5GdLQQ","session_id":"01d718a6-ac11-4c69-ac4b-36f76b2791b4","uuid":"563f5ef4-f99c-4ec4-98a4-843683ccdbbe","timestamp":"2026-05-13T03:21:27.253Z"}
