{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0163tmetaJWuGVZgNxgiFDNP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01V83f9twQcjZn1Cori6NCKe","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"acr-vla-conformal-refinement","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2310,"cache_read_input_tokens":16886,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2310,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":44,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U6BBV3mx4ktHfYbR5GdLQQ","session_id":"01d718a6-ac11-4c69-ac4b-36f76b2791b4","uuid":"2480157f-021e-4899-b90a-9660b4082fb3"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V83f9twQcjZn1Cori6NCKe","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_8/projects/acr-vla-conformal-refinement/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — acr-vla-conformal-refinement\\\\n\\\\n## MVP 实验关键洞察 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### Per-DOF vs 标量 uncertainty 的优势模式\\\\n- Per-DOF (B) 不仅在非扰动轴 (y,z) 大幅优于标量 (A)，**在扰动轴 (x) 也更好**。说明 per-DOF 特征提供的维度区分信息让模型在所有轴上都能更精准校正，而非仅仅\\\\\\\"忽略低不确定性轴\\\\\\\"。\\\\n- 这暗示 per-DOF uncertainty 的价值不仅是\\\\\\\"选择性校正\\\\\\\"，更是\\\\\\\"信息增益\\\\\\\"——模型能利用各轴不确定性的相对关系来理解当前状态。\\\\n\\\\n### Oracle vs K=10 估计的差距\\\\n- Oracle uncertainty 优势：y/z 轴改善 ~35-38%（vs A），K=10 估计：~20-24%。差距约 15pp。\\\\n- 关键约束：在真实 VLA 场景中，uncertainty 来自 ensemble/MC-dropout/conformal 估计，噪声更大。K=10 已经 pass 但边际较 oracle 缩小，需要关注后续更复杂场景下估计质量是否够用。\\\\n\\\\n### 各向异性比率的影响\\\\n- 即使 1.5:1 的低各向异性比率，per-DOF 仍然显著优于标量（y/z 轴 ~30% improvement with oracle）。说明 per-DOF 特征即使在温和的各向异性条件下也有价值，不要求极端的不确定性差异。\\\\n\\\\n## SmolVLA 架构关键参数 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### 模型规格\\\\n- HF repo: `lerobot/smolvla_base`（不是 HuggingFaceTB）\\\\n- 450M 参数，865MB 磁盘，0.86GB VRAM\\\\n- VLM backbone: SmolVLM2-500M-Video-Instruct (16 layers, cross_attn)\\\\n- **action_dim=6**（6 DOF，无 gripper），不是之前假设的 7\\\\n- **chunk_size=50**，不是之前假设的 H=5\\\\n- flow matching num_steps=10\\\\n\\\\n### K=10 推理性能\\\\n- K=1: 380ms\\\\n- K=10 sequential: 3931ms (393ms/sample)\\\\n- K=10 batched: **450ms**（8.7x 加速）\\\\n- 额外 VRAM 仅 +0.4GB → 总 1.33GB，24GB 4090 绰绰有余\\\\n\\\\n### 对代码框架的影响（必须更新）\\\\n- `action_dim`: 7 → 6（全局影响 CGS/CRM/utils）\\\\n- `horizon (chunk_size)`: 5 → 50（影响巨大）\\\\n  - mean_action: 35D → 300D\\\\n  - per_dof_std: 35D → 300D\\\\n  - conformal_radius: 5D → 50D\\\\n  - log_volume: 5D → 50D\\\\n  - CGS 总输出: 45D → 400D\\\\n  - CRM 输入维度大幅增加，可能需要调整架构\\\\n- 可能需要讨论是否对 50 步 horizon 做降维/分组处理\\\\n\\\\n## 环境搭建状态 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### 已安装\\\\n- robosuite 1.4.0 + libero 0.1.1 + mujoco 3.8.1\\\\n- 5 个 LIBERO benchmark: spatial/object/goal/90/10\\\\n- SmolVLA checkpoint 已下载\\\\n- 修复了 6 个环境问题（EGL、HF 503、版本冲突、groot patch、num2words、attention_mask dtype）\\\\n\\\\n### 待完成\\\\n- LIBERO demo 数据集需单独下载（.hdf5 文件）\\\\n- obs_features 维度待确认（取决于 SmolVLM2 encoder 输出）\\\\n- 代码框架需按实际 action_dim=6, chunk_size=50 更新\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1750, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U6BBV3mx4ktHfYbR5GdLQQ","session_id":"01d718a6-ac11-4c69-ac4b-36f76b2791b4","uuid":"140ae70e-2a21-472e-ad6a-d4491f30380a","timestamp":"2026-05-13T03:21:29.046Z"}
