{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017qnb678atJwJ74FmKEBwqk","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_8/projects/acr-vla-conformal-refinement/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# acr-vla-conformal-refinement — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-13 03:01 UTC | 更新原因: plan_001 启动：架构参数确认(D004) + 不等Dream直接P0(D005)\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n在 flow-matching VLA 上叠加在线自适应多元 conformal prediction + 学习型 CRM，用 per-DOF conformal 特征引导维度选择性动作校正。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP ✅, plan_001 启动中）\\\\n- **MVP**: per-DOF 全面碾压标量/无uncertainty baseline（oracle 30-39%, K=10 estimated 20-25%）\\\\n- **基础设施**: SmolVLA (450M params, 0.86GB VRAM, K=10 batched 450ms) + LIBERO 环境就绪\\\\n- **架构确认**: action_dim=6, H_eff=5 (截取 chunk_size=50 前 5 步), CGS 40D\\\\n- **Dream**: zombie（崩溃占槽），已决策不等 Dream 直接启动 P0\\\\n- **代码框架**: 7/7 核心模块已创建，待按实际参数更新\\\\n\\\\n## Kill Criteria\\\\n1. **A3 ablation (plan_002)**: CRM without conformal features 与 full ACR-VLA 差距 <2% → Claim 1 不成立\\\\n2. **COC 验证 (plan_005)**: Spearman ρ < 0.3 AND 无 >10% volume 收窄 → fallback episode-level ACI\\\\n3. **SRPO stacking (plan_004)**: gain < 2% → Claim 3 降级\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 Phase A: 下载 LIBERO demo + 更新代码(action_dim=6, H_eff=5) + 实现 train/eval 主体\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 Phase B: CRM 训练（LIBERO-Spatial + Object）\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 Phase C: 评估（LIBERO standard + LIBERO-Plus）\\\\n- [ ] Dream zombie 清理后重新提交\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 已分配: autodl-4090 (RTX 4090 × 1, cuda:0)\\\\n- plan_001: ~25h H100 ≈ 50-75h RTX 4090 (2-3 天)\\\\n- P0 总计: 59h H100 | P1: 51h | P2: 30h | 全项目: ~140h H100\\\\n- 目标: CoRL 2026 (May 29) 需 GPU 扩容; ICLR 2027 当前资源可行\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-13 | 不等 Dream 重新提交，直接启动 P0 实验。Dream zombie 占槽，Reviewer  | — |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-13 | Horizon 策略：截取 chunk 前 H_eff=5 步，action_dim=6。CGS 输 | — |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 通过，GO — 进入 research 阶段 | mvp-point-reaching |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-13 | 采纳 Reviewer 建议完善 MVP：增加 B vs C 对比（>5% MSE）、K=10 es | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 方案确定：3D Point-Reaching Motivating Experiment 验 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1794, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CbMGLemWBkKWmY689v1Ncm","session_id":"01d718a6-ac11-4c69-ac4b-36f76b2791b4","uuid":"68cf21ea-7604-4cb6-a342-f19c6717464d","timestamp":"2026-05-13T03:21:48.941Z"}
